** Probe: GRIDCART with explicit XPNTS/YPNTS on blank-keyword continuation
** lines, as EPA's allsrcs.inp writes them. Setup pass only.
** AERMOD said: accepted, 16 receptors (4 x 4); YPNTS accumulates over
** the two lines (XYPNTS keeps JCOUNT between records).
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  oracle 15: GRIDCART XPNTS YPNTS continuation lines
   MODELOPT  CONC  FLAT
   AVERTIME  1  24
   POLLUTID  SO2
   RUNORNOT  NOT
   ERRORFIL  15_gridcart_xpnts.err
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
   LOCATION  STACK1  POINT  0.0  0.0  0.0
   SRCPARAM  STACK1  500.0  65.00  425.  15.0  5.
   SRCGROUP  ALL
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
   GRIDCART  CAR1  STA
                   XPNTS  -1000.  -500.  500.  1000.
                   YPNTS  -1000.  -500.
                   YPNTS  500.  1000.
   GRIDCART  CAR1  END
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
   SURFFILE  AERMET2.SFC
   PROFFILE  AERMET2.PFL
   SURFDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   UAIRDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   PROFBASE  0.0  METERS
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
   RECTABLE  ALLAVE  FIRST
OU FINISHED
